{"answer": "1. 室外、铁塔安装无线局域网接入点（AP）设备综合单价为182.40元/套。[1]  \n2. 该价格包含安装与调测工作内容。[1]  \n3. 计量单位为“套”，适用于铁塔环境安装。[1]  \n4. 人工费为114.00元，占综合单价主要部分。[1]  \n5. 项目编码为WH23119004。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0009", "question": "室外、铁塔安装无线局域网接入点（AP）设备的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 62.3261359530843, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "a42aa1211b15c9b97d77cd11", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_c99cb6388d80a1445841", "block_index": 275, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 275, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 114, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第276页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_15cb5e40787da2f26b59", "page_number": 276, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_019db8eb098ab7f427ed", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_019db8eb098ab7f427ed", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第276页"], "section_title": "第276页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_c99cb6388d80a1445841"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "def