{"answer": "1. 一个扇区以下的调测基站系统综合单价为2134.08元。[1]  \n2. 该价格适用于3个扇区以下的基站系统调测工作。[1]  \n3. 综合单价包含人工、企业管理费及利润。[1]  \n4. 计量单位为“站”或“扇区”。[1]  \n5. 若超出3个扇区，需按增量计价。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0010", "question": "一个扇区以下的调测基站系统，其综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 65.69583694018405, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "74a531a7af4a27cd02a5f285", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_2c8790ada3fa21dcb7db", "block_index": 271, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 271, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 89, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第272页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_3bc17d02a311822f19c5", "page_number": 272, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_01cdc113eac5363b6ca3", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_01cdc113eac5363b6ca3", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第272页"], "section_title": "第272页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_2c8790ada3fa21dcb7db"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "text": "章节：电信基础设施维护规程 > 第272页 页码：272 T/CAICI XXXX—XXXX 266 表10.3.3.16 WH23116 调测基站系统 工作内容：1、调测基站系统：硬件检验、数据配置、设备状态检查、软件自检、传输验证、工程验证、文档整理； 2、配合调测基站系统：测试区域的协调、设备硬件连接端口调整、自带开关开合； 3、联网调测：覆盖测试、呼叫质量测试、数据服务质量测试、切换测试、干扰测试、告警测试、优化调整天线方位角、下倾角和发射功率等工程参 数，数据整理等。 4、配合联网调测：配合基站割接、开通：测试区域协调、硬件调整等。 计量单位：站、扇区 维护分项作业 项目编码 项目名称 综合单价 （元） 其中 名称 人工 人工费(元) 企业管理费(元) 利润(元) 技工 普工 单位 工日 单价(元) 114.00 61.00 WH23116001 调测基站系统 3 个扇区以下 2134.08 1333.80 400.14 400.14 消耗量 11.70 — WH23116002 3 个扇区以上每增加一 个扇区 326.50 204.06 61.22 61.22 1.79 WH23116003 配合调测基站系统 扇区 257.18 160.74 48.22 48.22 1.41 WH23116004 联网调测 扇区 895.58 559.74 167.92 167.92 4.91 WH23116005 配合联网调测 （站） 384.86 240.54 72.16 72.16 2.11 — WH23116006 配合基站割接、开通 237.12 148.20 44.46 44.46 1.30 — 注：远端与近端的距离相距1km 以上的拉远站，配合调测综合单价乘以系数1.2。"}, "keyword_score": 1.0, "normalized_bm25_score": 1.0, "rerank_score": null, "retrieval_score": 0.8435345437249278, "score": 0.8435345437249278, "semantic_score": 0.7764779196070398}, {"bm25_score": 17.083923987642688, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "5e45e6a75fd83aff3cbcb2ea", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_de3bb8dd6938f55f00bf", "block_index": 265, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 265, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 72, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第266页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_d48e8810d01a78822dda", "page_number": 266, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_