{"answer": "1. 山区铁塔技术测试中塔基回弹值的综合单价为13.68元。[1]  \n2. 该价格对应项目编码WH22105006，计量单位为座·次。[1]  \n3. 综合单价包含人工、企业管理费及利润。[1]  \n4. 此项测试属于铁塔技术测试工作内容之一。[1]  \n5. 与市区和平原/丘陵地区相比，山区单价更高。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0015", "question": "山区铁塔技术测试中塔基回弹值的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 66.90835502063669, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "68a1c1448a91e95c36a18aa3", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b", "block_index": 248, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 248, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 84, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_f226dbe905d18319b912", "page_number": 249, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_7d1dc81c9f062a6eddad", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第249页"], "section_title": "第249页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_9a4c53dcbf86891bd81b"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础设施维护规程", "version_id": "v_8ae9b63d869002c1"}, "t