{"answer": "1. 架顶式机架安装综合单价为109.44元/架。[1]  \n2. 该价格包含开箱检验、搬运、定位、固定等工序。[1]  \n3. 计量单位为“架”，适用于架顶式安装场景。[1]  \n4. 人工费占比约62.5%（68.40元）。[1]  \n5. 项目编码为WH23102003。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0017", "question": "安装架顶式机架的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 18.414345206660265, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "0ad5d80a4efb5c59af2f68f2", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_8b22b598622552535f63", "block_index": 250, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 250, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 97, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第251页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_c541def97977360a1ca9", "page_number": 251, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_d65193f07d5e8dca7210", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_d65193f07d5e8dca7210", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第251页"], "section_title": "第251页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_8b22b598622552535f63"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "tenant_id": "default", "title": "电信基础