{"answer": "1. WH33118003项目中太阳能光伏离网发电系统的综合单价为33.02元。[1]  \n2. 该单价对应计量单位为台·次。[1]  \n3. 综合单价包含人工、企业管理费及利润。[1]  \n4. 项目编码WH33118003属于发电设备专项检修类别。[1]  \n5. 该信息来源于《电信基础设施维护规程》第318页。[1]", "case_id": "p6s-0020", "question": "WH33118003 项目中太阳能光伏离网发电系统的综合单价是多少元？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 64.25633849003982, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "8be5803c7b6b81a6c36af5bd", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_065aee4417bf2bc9bb9a", "block_index": 317, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "设备维护", "chunk_index": 317, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 59, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第318页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_db4ef65a5a2b90112e8d", "page_number": 318, "page_warning_codes": ["bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_a87f75b9105c754e92a6", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_a87f75b9105c754e92a6", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第318页"], "section_title": "第318页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_065aee4417bf2bc9bb9a"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped", "table_parser_route": "deepdoc", "